#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:3
#: 7ebd539e4a5b40fcb8e5bb4727b9b662
msgid "Website style guide"
msgstr "網站風格指南"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:6
#: 247321ad6817454dbc560ae504747ae0
msgid ""
"This page explains the standards we follow for building and maintaining the "
"website. Please follow these guidelines and conventions when modifying the "
"website. For the standards governing the documentation in particular, please "
"see the :doc:`documentation style guide </developer/general/rst-"
"documentation-style-guide>`."
msgstr ""
"此頁面說明我們在建置和維護網站時遵循的標準。修改網站時請遵循這些指南和慣例。"
"關於文件方面的標準，請參閱 :doc:`文件風格指南 </developer/general/rst-"
"documentation-style-guide>`。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:10
#: 7db5559497bb4b489e644d14d8db3712
msgid "Coding conventions"
msgstr "程式碼慣例"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:12
#: 22d4373e332a42c890122ae855887324
msgid ""
"The following conventions apply to the website as a whole, including "
"everything written in HTML, CSS, YAML, and Liquid. These conventions are "
"intended to keep the codebase consistent when multiple collaborators are "
"working on it. They should be understood as a practical set of rules for "
"maintaining order in this specific codebase rather than as a statement of "
"what is objectively right or good."
msgstr ""
"以下慣例適用於整個網站，包括用 HTML、CSS、YAML 和 Liquid 編寫的所有內容。這些"
"慣例旨在多位協作者同時工作時保持程式碼庫的一致性。它們應被理解為一套維護此特"
"定程式碼庫秩序的實用規則，而非客觀正確或良好的陳述。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:15
#: 759bc78b94924456830c61a0e5ea6f81
msgid "General practices"
msgstr "一般做法"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:18
#: ae5251365df84b0ca12851a0647d8059
msgid ""
"Use comments to indicate the purposes of different blocks of code. This "
"makes the file easier to understand and navigate."
msgstr "使用註釋來說明不同程式碼區塊的目的。這使檔案更易於理解和導覽。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:20
#: e744c8b4df95469295ba20f0540dba3d
msgid ""
"Use descriptive variable names. Never use one or two letter variable names. "
"Avoid obscure abbreviations and made-up words."
msgstr ""
"使用描述性的變數名稱。切勿使用一或兩個字母的變數名稱。避免晦澀的縮寫和自創詞"
"語。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:22
#: a1fc0800b3404cbaab01d67133e83214
msgid ""
"In general, make it easy for others to read your code. Your future self will "
"thank you, and so will your collaborators!"
msgstr ""
"一般來說，讓他人容易閱讀您的程式碼。未來的您會感謝自己，您的協作者也會！"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:24
#: 227306025801497ba0aa0b470c742303
msgid ""
"`Don’t Repeat Yourself (DRY)! <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Don%27t_repeat_yourself>`__ Instead of repeating the same block of code "
"multiple times, abstract it out into a separate file and ``include`` that "
"file where you need it."
msgstr ""
"`不要重複自己（DRY）！<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Don%27t_repeat_yourself>`__ 與其多次重複相同的程式碼區塊，不如將其抽象到單獨"
"的檔案中，並在需要的地方 ``include`` 該檔案。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:27
#: 173b8f6e6c2043ee86905f0f186a1178
msgid "Whitespace"
msgstr "空白字元"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:29
#: 98810e3783474aa8b0c3fe6d7dc174a7
msgid "Always use spaces. Never use tabs."
msgstr "始終使用空格。切勿使用定位符號。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:30
#: df90356b57bf46fb8eb60671a99f6125
msgid "Each indentation step should be exactly two (2) spaces."
msgstr "每個縮排層級應恰好為兩（2）個空格。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:31
#: 98bff787bd264c23a509738f39170da7
msgid ""
"Whenever you add an opening tag, indent the following line. (Exception: If "
"you open and close the tag on the same line, do not indent the following "
"line.)"
msgstr ""
"每當您新增開始標籤時，縮排下一行。（例外：如果您在同一行開啟和關閉標籤，則不"
"要縮排下一行。）"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:32
#: 011904038bcb4a1f992c4dc385581efa
msgid "Indent Liquid the same way as HTML."
msgstr "Liquid 的縮排方式與 HTML 相同。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:33
#: 81349462834d4c999491d602c9992384
msgid ""
"In general, the starting columns of every adjacent pair of lines should be "
"no more than two spaces apart (example below)."
msgstr "一般來說，每相鄰兩行的起始欄位間距不應超過兩個空格（如下例所示）。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:34
#: 6812388adbc44fdaa88e1d58ec575d6a
msgid ""
"No blank or empty lines. (Hint: When you feel you need one, add a comment on "
"that line instead.)"
msgstr "不要有空行。（提示：當您覺得需要空行時，請在該行新增註釋。）"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:38
#: 88fb128344ca47f582300679f55ff3be
msgid "Indentation example"
msgstr "縮排範例"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:40
#: 1b247021d7e04309ab4d56adf600de23
msgid "Here’s an example that follows the indentation rules:"
msgstr "以下是一個遵循縮排規則的範例："

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:62
#: efb7b3b5fa87451d9a6ee565e48f48d6
msgid "Markdown style guide and conventions"
msgstr "Markdown 風格指南與慣例"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:65
#: 700a18316f434f27a6443651cce75d7b
msgid ""
"*Also see* :doc:`How to edit the website </developer/general/how-to-edit-the-"
"website>`."
msgstr ""
"*另請參閱* :doc:`如何編輯網站 </developer/general/how-to-edit-the-website>`。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:67
#: 0fcb675d0b604ce08669e86aff808906
msgid ""
"Some of the Qubes OS website pages are stored as plain text Markdown files "
"in the `qubesos.github.io <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubesos.github.io>`__ "
"repository. When making contributions to Markdown files, please observe the "
"following style conventions. If you’re not familiar with Markdown syntax, "
"`this <https://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/>`__ is a great resource."
msgstr ""
"部分 Qubes OS 網站頁面以純文字 Markdown 檔案儲存在 `qubesos.github.io "
"<https://github.com/QubesOS/qubesos.github.io>`__ 儲存庫中。在對 Markdown 檔"
"案做出貢獻時，請遵守以下風格慣例。如果您不熟悉 Markdown 語法，`此處 <https://"
"daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/>`__ 是一個很好的資源。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:71
#: 4ab6eb5a9ade4a51a540a86fb64bac7c
msgid "Hyperlink syntax"
msgstr "超連結語法"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:73
#: b2f47dd505a44b97828e3b29e917d7b4
msgid ""
"Use non-reference-style links like :code:`[website](https://example.com/)`. "
"Do *not* use reference-style links like ``[website][example]``, ``[website]"
"[]`` or ``[website]``. This facilitates the localization process."
msgstr ""
"使用非參考風格的連結，例如 :code:`[website](https://example.com/)`。*不要*使"
"用參考風格的連結，例如 ``[website][example]``、``[website][]`` 或 "
"``[website]``。這有助於在地化流程。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:76
#: 309471f8cca344a0b696d7df5298b7b6
msgid "Relative vs. absolute links"
msgstr "相對 vs. 絕對連結"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:78
#: 5970ac35ec5e43b7881601fc0605aced
msgid ""
"Always use relative rather than absolute paths for internal website links. "
"For example, use ``/donate/`` instead of ``https://www.qubes-os.org/donate/"
"``."
msgstr ""
"對於內部網站連結，始終使用相對路徑而非絕對路徑。例如，使用 ``/donate/`` 而非 "
"``https://www.qubes-os.org/donate/``。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:80
#: 559c1628949b4c89a6edbb34df61f472
msgid "You may use absolute URLs in the following cases:"
msgstr "在以下情況下可以使用絕對 URL："

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:82
#: 5cf14e1f12f74e2dae93473cf34b1caf
msgid "External links"
msgstr "外部連結"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:83
#: 776755f6ec9149bba1817e4795770a17
msgid ""
"URLs that appear inside code blocks (e.g., in comments and document "
"templates, and the plain text reproductions of `QSBs <https://www.qubes-os."
"org/security/qsb/>`__ and `Canaries <https://www.qubes-os.org/security/"
"canary/>`__), since they’re not hyperlinks"
msgstr ""
"出現在程式碼區塊內的 URL（例如註釋和文件範本中，以及 `QSB <https://www.qubes-"
"os.org/security/qsb/>`__ 和 `Canary <https://www.qubes-os.org/security/"
"canary/>`__ 的純文字複本），因為它們不是超連結"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:84
#: 84baf4eeddd44db6be0822cf90656fb9
msgid ""
"Git repo files like ``README.md`` and ``CONTRIBUTING.md``, since they’re not "
"part of the website itself but rather of the auxiliary infrastructure "
"supporting the website"
msgstr ""
"Git 儲存庫檔案如 ``README.md`` 和 ``CONTRIBUTING.md``，因為它們不是網站本身的"
"一部分，而是支援網站的輔助基礎設施"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:87
#: 49516849b7cc45c4bcd6b5e8c59fe6f5
msgid ""
"This rule is important because using absolute URLs for internal website "
"links breaks:"
msgstr "此規則很重要，因為對內部網站連結使用絕對 URL 會破壞："

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:89
#: 5f7abfc4e3c04a4b8270572f6f5694af
msgid "Serving the website offline"
msgstr "離線提供網站服務"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:90
#: a02cb869d6b9435a8570413392632e2c
msgid "Website localization"
msgstr "網站在地化"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:91
#: 02431a72616c4f5b91957689a4988ed2
msgid "Generating offline documentation"
msgstr "生成離線文件"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:92
#: 232ad0b00c834f3289c5cd99df95fcee
msgid ""
"Automatically redirecting Tor Browser visitors to the correct page on the "
"onion service mirror"
msgstr "自動將 Tor Browser 訪客重新導向至洋蔥服務鏡像上的正確頁面"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:96
#: a14963f1c007404291d8c7dd53cfe1c2
msgid "Image linking"
msgstr "圖片連結"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:98
#: f8023a14e44d43ff9e99245348f64279
msgid ""
"To add an image to a page, use the following syntax in the main document."
msgstr "若要將圖片新增到頁面，請在主文件中使用以下語法。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:104
#: 3e73517bd7a34cb28ae658fa5c353fce
msgid ""
"This will make the image a hyperlink to the image file, allowing the reader "
"to click on the image in order to view the full image by itself. This is "
"important. Following best practices, our website has a responsive design, "
"which allows the website to render appropriately across all screen sizes. "
"When viewing this page on a smaller screen, such as on a mobile device, the "
"image will automatically shrink down to fit the screen. If visitors cannot "
"click on the image to view it in full size, then, depending on their device, "
"they may have no way see the details in the image clearly."
msgstr ""
"這會使圖片成為圖片檔案的超連結，允許讀者點擊圖片以單獨檢視完整圖片。這很重"
"要。遵循最佳實踐，我們的網站具有響應式設計，可在所有螢幕尺寸上適當呈現。在較"
"小的螢幕（例如行動裝置）上檢視此頁面時，圖片會自動縮小以適應螢幕。如果訪客無"
"法點擊圖片以檢視完整尺寸，則根據他們的裝置，他們可能無法清楚看到圖片中的細"
"節。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:106
#: 5d36c1b723744ae79c4d3a29a86d019b
msgid ""
"In addition, make sure to link only to images in the `qubes-attachment "
"<https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-attachment>`__ repository. Do not attempt "
"to link to images hosted on other websites."
msgstr ""
"此外，確保僅連結到 `qubes-attachment <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-"
"attachment>`__ 儲存庫中的圖片。不要嘗試連結到位於其他網站上的圖片。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:109
#: 36ace2d582cc4b76801f22001c6e5a2a
msgid "HTML and CSS"
msgstr "HTML 與 CSS"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:112
#: 8dd7d44ccf7148deab26ea71b1bada87
msgid ""
"Do not write HTML inside Markdown documents (except in rare, unavoidable "
"cases, such as :ref:`developer/general/website-style-guide:alerts`). In "
"particular, never include HTML or CSS for styling, formatting, or white "
"space control. That belongs in the (S)CSS files instead."
msgstr ""
"不要在 Markdown 文件中編寫 HTML（除非在罕見且無可避免的情況下，例如 :ref:`警"
"示 <developer/general/website-style-guide:alerts>`）。特別是，切勿為了樣式、"
"格式或空白控制而包含 HTML 或 CSS。那些應放在 (S)CSS 檔案中。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:115
#: 40b2337890eb446da648201c580e9352
msgid "Headings"
msgstr "標題"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:117
#: 794c014d955841c6901700a68a0487ce
msgid ""
"Do not use ``h1`` headings (single ``#`` or ``======`` underline). These are "
"automatically generated from the ``title:`` line in the YAML front matter."
msgstr ""
"不要使用 ``h1`` 標題（單一 ``#`` 或 ``======`` 底線）。這些會從 YAML 前置資料"
"中的 ``title:`` 行自動生成。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:119
#: 0b34f806b8bd414bb0df47ae575f8605
msgid ""
"Use Atx-style syntax for headings: ``##h2``, ``### h3``, etc. Do not use "
"underlining syntax (``-----``)."
msgstr ""
"使用 Atx 風格的標題語法：``## h2``、``### h3`` 等。不要使用底線語法（``-----"
"``）。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:122
#: a69f5364f4814600a2dfb61f3189d7aa
msgid "Indentation"
msgstr "縮排"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:124
#: 8ce8e3de1b6e464786eaf388bd0ad053
msgid "Use spaces instead of tabs. Use hanging indentations where appropriate."
msgstr "使用空格而非定位符號。在適當的地方使用懸掛縮排。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:127
#: c51f35d7c69f402582833ac0ca5127fa
msgid "Lists"
msgstr "列表"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:129
#: 1e5cf1f9ecda4686844ab0bbb615860a
msgid ""
"If appropriate, make numerals in numbered lists match between Markdown "
"source and HTML output. Some users read the Markdown source directly, and "
"this makes numbered lists easier to follow."
msgstr ""
"如果合適，讓編號列表中的數字在 Markdown 來源碼和 HTML 輸出之間保持一致。有些"
"使用者直接閱讀 Markdown 來源碼，這使編號列表更易於理解。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:132
#: de5d297a52014b1dacbce58ff2d5d815
msgid "Code blocks"
msgstr "程式碼區塊"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:134
#: 88ad88bb829747dda20f0a8f8f75f168
msgid ""
"When writing code blocks, use `syntax highlighting <https://github.github."
"com/gfm/#info-string>`__ where possible (see `here <https://github.com/jneen/"
"rouge/wiki/List-of-supported-languages-and-lexers>`__ for a list of "
"supported languages). Use ``[...]`` for anything omitted."
msgstr ""
"在編寫程式碼區塊時，盡可能使用 `語法高亮 <https://github.github.com/gfm/"
"#info-string>`__（參閱 `此處 <https://github.com/jneen/rouge/wiki/List-of-"
"supported-languages-and-lexers>`__了解支援的語言列表）。使用 ``[...]`` 表示省"
"略的內容。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:137
#: 5dd3b5d83ebb44ea949482fbe9b4a0ee
msgid "Line wrapping"
msgstr "換行"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:139
#: f6d333a5bbaf4f839870f1b75790e05e
msgid ""
"Do not hard wrap text, except where necessary (e.g., inside code blocks)."
msgstr "不要強制換行，除非必要（例如在程式碼區塊內）。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:142
#: acfd612614bc423491b38341bb99d30e
msgid "Do not use Markdown syntax for styling"
msgstr "不要使用 Markdown 語法進行風格設計"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:144
#: c032113f82624c7db00614615473b1db
msgid ""
"For example, there is a common temptation to use block quotations (created "
"by beginning lines with the ``>`` character) in order to stylistically "
"distinguish some portion of text from the rest of the document, e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"例如，常見的誘惑是使用塊引用（以 ``>`` 字元開頭的行）來在風格上將某些文字與文"
"件的其他部分區分開來，例如："

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:152
#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:171
#: 19b3e2a872d545b2af17d5eb21d353cd c4602c149df14a8b99a0d095320ef23f
msgid "This renders as:"
msgstr "此呈現為："

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:154
#: 79198ba4f5bd4cd88154ea4e8114bb5b
msgid "**Note:** This is an important note!"
msgstr "**注意：** 這是一條重要的備註！"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:156
#: 27dc2de19dfd49e6804dbe38032308f0
msgid "There are two problems with this:"
msgstr "這有兩個問題："

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:158
#: f173e5ec5c784e7bb83b95453ca53901
msgid ""
"It is a violation of the `separation of content and presentation <https://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Separation_of_content_and_presentation>`__, since it "
"abuses markup syntax in order to achieve unintended stylistic results. The "
"Markdown (and HTML, if any) should embody the *content* of the "
"documentation, while the *presentation* is handled by (S)CSS."
msgstr ""
"這違反了 `內容與表現分離 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Separation_of_content_and_presentation>`__ 的原則，因為它濫用標記語法以達到非"
"預期的風格效果。Markdown（以及任何 HTML）應體現文件的\\ *內容*\\ ，而\\ *呈現"
"*\\ 則由 (S)CSS 處理。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:160
#: 6fbfa0fa72a441f594365167c1b03e7d
msgid ""
"It is an abuse of quotation syntax for text that is not actually a "
"quotation. (You are not quoting anyone here. You’re just telling the reader "
"to note something and trying to draw their attention to your note visually.)"
msgstr ""
"這是對並非實際引用的文字濫用引用語法。（您並不是在引用任何人。您只是在告訴讀"
"者注意某事，並試圖在視覺上吸引他們的注意力。）"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:164
#: 0be92563c1bf46ee95436779da13559b
msgid ""
"Instead, an example of an appropriate way to stylistically distinguish a "
"portion of text is by using :ref:`developer/general/website-style-guide:"
"alerts`. Consider also that extra styling and visual distinction may not "
"even be necessary. In most cases, traditional writing methods are perfectly "
"sufficient, e.g.,:"
msgstr ""
"相反地，一個在風格上區分文字部分的適當方式範例是使用 :ref:`警示 <developer/"
"general/website-style-guide:alerts>`。也要考慮到額外的樣式和視覺區分可能根本"
"沒有必要。在多數情況下，傳統的寫作方法就完全足夠了，例如："

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:173
#: 5abf4daa657c409081889564474f90f8
msgid "**Note:** This is an important note."
msgstr "**注意：** 這是一條重要的備註。"

#: ../../../developer/general/website-style-guide.rst:176
